# Lost ACK with idempotent retransmission (issue #7).
# Collector persists durably, ACK is dropped on the wire, node retransmits
# the same bytes after reconnect; duplicate persistence is idempotent and a
# later ACK succeeds through the real high-watermark logic.
name: ble-lost-ack
version: 1
description: Dropped ACK, duplicate batch, idempotent collector, retry succeeds.

boot
import_fixture_node sim-main
claim_mode_enter
claim_as admin
assert last_claim ok
rtc SYNCED 1790899200000
read CHIP-A
read CHIP-B
read CHIP-C
assert observations 3
phone_connect
provide_credential member
assert last_auth ok
ble_batch 1 16
assert batch_count 3
collector_persist
assert collector_persisted 3
# ACK is dropped after durable persist: node watermark unchanged.
drop_ack
reconnect
provide_credential member
assert last_auth ok
# Node retransmits the same batch; collector handles duplicates idempotently.
ble_batch 1 16
assert batch_count 3
collector_persist
assert collector_persisted 3
assert collector_watermark 3
send_ack
assert last_ack ok
assert ack_watermark 3
ble_compact
assert observations 0
sync_complete
phone_disconnect
